<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka forex market closed for holiday.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka forex market closed for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka's forex markets were closed on Tuesday for a special bank holiday.</p>
<p>Trading resumes on January 1.</p>
<p>The rupee ended the year at 56.70 to the dollar on Monday.</p>
<p>--Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
